WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.235
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.237
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.405
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.840
During a rally over
the weekend in Texas,

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.343
former president Trump said that
if he wins the 2024 election,

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.879
he will consider pardoning
the people charged with

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.913
participating in
the Capitol attack.

00:00:14.913 --> 00:00:18.418
"In that case, I was there,"
said Ghislaine Maxwell.

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:23.222
During the same rally,
former president Trump

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:26.659
told supporters that, "In 2024,
we're going to take back

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.662
that beautiful, beautiful house
that happens to be white,

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.399
but it's not the one
you're thinking of."

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.702
In a new interview,
Maine Senator Susan Collins

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:38.671
criticized
President Biden for announcing

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:41.140
that he will nominate a
black woman to the Supreme Court

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.441
and said that he,

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:45.311
"Helped politicize
the entire nomination process."

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:48.281
Collins' comments have drawn
a stern rebuke from

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:51.384
the Black Republican Women
of Maine.

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.588
ESPN reported on Saturday that

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.290
Tampa Bay Buccaneers
quarterback Tom Brady

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.693
will retire after 22 seasons,
seven Super Bowl titles,

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:04.063
and -- oh, what do you know? --
zero field goals.

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:08.601
Well, guess he wasn't that
great after all.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:12.272
Former White House adviser
Kellyanne Conway

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.507
announced last week that
she will release a memoir

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.710
in May called "Here's the Deal,"
which is also the name of

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.979
the bookstore bin
where you'll find it.

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.815
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:25.618
Kid Rock announced last week --
Kid Rock news. Quiet down.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.186
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:29.922
Kid Rock announced last week
that he will not perform

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:31.323
at any venue that requires

00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:33.259
coronavirus vaccines
or face masks.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.795
Well, if anyone is going to
ignore the science,

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:39.199
it's a 51-year-old man
named Kid.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:44.203
Tesla recently began selling an
in-car karaoke microphone

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:46.338
in China,
and that seems like trouble

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:50.343
considering how drunk
you have to be to do karaoke.

00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:55.247
Today was
National Hot Chocolate Day.

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:57.050
Ugh! Well, she used to be.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.085
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:14.733
And, finally,
a federal judge in Oklahoma

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:17.170
re-sentenced
Netflix's "Tiger King" star

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.505
Joe Exotic to 21 years
in prison last week.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.074
Letting him out any sooner would

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:24.444
put the public at risk
for a third season.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.814
Hard to follow hot chocolate.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.849
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.919
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

